# Joraga Invocation: "must be blocked this turn if able" (CR 509.1c) asks nothing where no block is possible. Bot1 attacks with Savannah Lions
# (5/4) and Ornithopter (3/5, flying); Bot2's only creature, Grizzly Bears, can't block a flier, so it is required to block only the Lions:
# declaring no block is refused, blocking is accepted, and the Ornithopter is unblocked and deals 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Savannah Lions
Ornithopter
Joraga Invocation
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

